From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: amatiramisu <261696294+amatiramisu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:02:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] win32u, winewayland.drv: DSR desktop modes above the
 native resolution.

Adds desktop modes at area factors of each monitor's native mode
(NVIDIA's 1.20x to 4.00x by default, set with WINE_DSR_FACTORS). The
Vulkan swapchain reduces the image to the monitor, averaging pixel
blocks at whole factors. Monitor lookups no longer lose windows below
96 DPI.
---
 dlls/win32u/sysparams.c                | 147 ++++++++++++++++-
 dlls/win32u/vulkan.c                   | 209 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_pointer.c |   8 +
 3 files changed, 355 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

